{"author":"Kenan Firmansyah","category":"Game mechanic","dimension":"","extensionNamespace":"","fullName":"Vision","gdevelopVersion":"","helpPath":"","iconUrl":"","name":"Vision","previewIconUrl":"","shortDescription":"A vision cone with a memory: range, angle, last known position and a forgetting clock.","version":"1.0.0","description":"Cheap perception for an enemy. CanSee tests range then angle. Saw remembers where the target was. Tick counts time since the last sighting. Forgot becomes true once that time passes Memory. Line of sight is a raycast event in the scene. Written for IMT01306618 Week 11.","tags":["ai","vision"],"authorIds":[],"dependencies":[],"globalVariables":[],"sceneVariables":[],"eventsFunctions":[],"eventsFunctionsFolderStructure":{"folderName":"__ROOT"},"eventsBasedBehaviors":[{"description":"A vision cone (range and half angle) plus a last known position that decays.","fullName":"Vision","helpPath":"","iconUrl":"","name":"Vision","objectType":"","previewIconUrl":"","eventsFunctions":[{"description":"True when the target is inside the range and inside the cone. Does not look for walls.","fullName":"Can see","functionType":"Condition","name":"CanSee","sentence":"_PARAM0_ can see _PARAM2_ (range and angle only)","events":[{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::JsCode","inlineCode":["const b = eventsFunctionContext.getObjects(\"Object\")[0]","  .getBehavior(eventsFunctionContext.getBehaviorName(\"Behavior\"));","const me = eventsFunctionContext.getObjects(\"Object\")[0];","const target = eventsFunctionContext.getObjects(\"target\")[0];","if (!target) { eventsFunctionContext.returnValue = false; return; }","","const dx = target.getCenterXInScene() - me.getCenterXInScene();","const dy = target.getCenterYInScene() - me.getCenterYInScene();","","// 1. Range: the cheapest test. Most targets stop here.","if (Math.hypot(dx, dy) > b._getRange()) { eventsFunctionContext.returnValue = false; return; }","","// 2. Angle: how far is the target from where I am facing? Wrap into -180..180.","const toTarget = Math.atan2(dy, dx) * 180 / Math.PI;","const off = ((toTarget - me.getAngle()) % 360 + 540) % 360 - 180;","eventsFunctionContext.returnValue = Math.abs(off) <= b._getHalfAngle();","// 3. Line of sight is NOT here. It is a raycast event in the scene."],"parameterObjects":"","useStrict":true,"eventsSheetExpanded":true}],"parameters":[{"description":"Object","name":"Object","type":"object"},{"description":"Behavior","name":"Behavior","supplementaryInformation":"Vision::Vision","type":"behavior"},{"description":"target","name":"target","type":"objectList"}],"objectGroups":[]},{"description":"Remember where the target is and restart the forgetting clock.","fullName":"Saw target","functionType":"Action","name":"Saw","sentence":"_PARAM0_ saw _PARAM2_: remember where, restart the clock","events":[{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::JsCode","inlineCode":["const b = eventsFunctionContext.getObjects(\"Object\")[0]","  .getBehavior(eventsFunctionContext.getBehaviorName(\"Behavior\"));","const target = eventsFunctionContext.getObjects(\"target\")[0];","if (!target) return;","b._setLastX(target.getCenterXInScene());   // where it was","b._setLastY(target.getCenterYInScene());","b._setSinceSeen(0);                        // the memory clock restarts"],"parameterObjects":"","useStrict":true,"eventsSheetExpanded":true}],"parameters":[{"description":"Object","name":"Object","type":"object"},{"description":"Behavior","name":"Behavior","supplementaryInformation":"Vision::Vision","type":"behavior"},{"description":"target","name":"target","type":"objectList"}],"objectGroups":[]},{"description":"Add the frame time to the time since the target was last seen. Use TimeDelta().","fullName":"Tick","functionType":"Action","name":"Tick","sentence":"Count _PARAM2_ seconds since _PARAM0_ last saw its target","events":[{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::JsCode","inlineCode":["const b = eventsFunctionContext.getObjects(\"Object\")[0]","  .getBehavior(eventsFunctionContext.getBehaviorName(\"Behavior\"));","// Call once per frame, BEFORE the sighting events, so that \"saw\" resets it.","b._setSinceSeen(b._getSinceSeen() + eventsFunctionContext.getArgument(\"delta\"));"],"parameterObjects":"","useStrict":true,"eventsSheetExpanded":true}],"parameters":[{"description":"Object","name":"Object","type":"object"},{"description":"Behavior","name":"Behavior","supplementaryInformation":"Vision::Vision","type":"behavior"},{"description":"delta","name":"delta","type":"expression"}],"objectGroups":[]},{"description":"True once the time since the target was last seen passes Memory.","fullName":"Forgot target","functionType":"Condition","name":"Forgot","sentence":"_PARAM0_ has forgotten its target","events":[{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::JsCode","inlineCode":["const b = eventsFunctionContext.getObjects(\"Object\")[0]","  .getBehavior(eventsFunctionContext.getBehaviorName(\"Behavior\"));","eventsFunctionContext.returnValue = b._getSinceSeen() > b._getMemory();"],"parameterObjects":"","useStrict":true,"eventsSheetExpanded":true}],"parameters":[{"description":"Object","name":"Object","type":"object"},{"description":"Behavior","name":"Behavior","supplementaryInformation":"Vision::Vision","type":"behavior"}],"objectGroups":[]}],"eventsFunctionsFolderStructure":{"folderName":"__ROOT","children":[{"functionName":"CanSee"},{"functionName":"Saw"},{"functionName":"Tick"},{"functionName":"Forgot"}]},"propertyDescriptors":[{"value":"300","type":"Number","label":"Range","name":"Range"},{"value":"40","type":"Number","label":"HalfAngle","name":"HalfAngle"},{"value":"3","type":"Number","label":"Memory","name":"Memory"},{"value":"0","type":"Number","label":"LastX","name":"LastX"},{"value":"0","type":"Number","label":"LastY","name":"LastY"},{"value":"0","type":"Number","label":"SinceSeen","name":"SinceSeen"}],"propertiesFolderStructure":{"folderName":"__ROOT","children":[{"propertyName":"Range"},{"propertyName":"HalfAngle"},{"propertyName":"Memory"},{"propertyName":"LastX"},{"propertyName":"LastY"},{"propertyName":"SinceSeen"}]}}],"eventsBasedObjects":[]}